.TH LUMOS\-MD 1 2026-10-25 "lumos\-md 0.1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lumos\-md \- Markdown editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lumos\-md
.RI [ file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lumos\-md
edits Markdown files as source text, with syntax colours and format
commands. It follows CommonMark and GitHub Flavored Markdown. Every edit
is a text edit.
.PP
With a
.IR file ,
it opens that file. Without one, it opens an empty document.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print the options and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I \(ti/.config/lumos\-md/lumos\-md.ini
The settings. For debug lines in the log, add
.B debug=true
under
.B [log]
in this file.
.TP
.I \(ti/.local/state/lumos\-md/lumos\-md.log
The log, one line per event. At 1 MB it moves to
.IR lumos\-md.log.1 .
.TP
.I \(ti/.lumos\-md/
If
.I \(ti/.lumos\-md/lumos\-md.ini
exists, the settings and the log are in this directory instead.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Replaces
.I \(ti/.config
in the paths above.
.TP
.B XDG_STATE_HOME
Replaces
.I \(ti/.local/state
in the paths above.
.SH BUGS
https://github.com/confund0/lumos\-md/issues
